          %h2#references  References
          %p The axiom of well-founded materialization, the structural axiom of extensionality (the strong terminal generator condition of well-pointedness), and the structural axiom schemata of separation and collection could be found in:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Shulman"} Michael Shulman
              (2018). Comparing material and structural set theories.
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1808.05204"} arXiv:1808.05204
          %p The rest of the axioms are standard axioms from categorical set theory (or the type theoretic equivalent).
